Notebook[{
Cell["Unit 2 \[CenterDot] Mathematics as Data", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"fa1e3920-05ad-4aa6-95e4-3d2258ec644c"],

Cell["\<\
Trees, prefix notation, fair sampling and checked answers (Lample and \
Charton, 2019) \[LongDash] TensorNets units of learning, 2 of 4\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"831d2f42-95b2-419a-b038-a40a3bf4cc2f"],

Cell["\[Copyright] 2026 Computational Classnotes \[CenterDot] CC BY-NC-SA \
4.0", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7341998b-41e9-41bb-88a2-d14329ca538d"],

Cell["\<\
A neural net can learn to integrate if integration is written as translation: \
the problem is one sequence, its solution another. Lample and Charton (2019) \
trained a standard transformer this way. What was new was the data. This unit \
builds their data machinery: trees in prefix notation, counting and fair \
sampling of trees, three ways of making integration problems, and checking \
every answer. Evaluate the notebook from top to bottom; it takes about a \
minute. The write-up \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Unit 2 \[CenterDot] Mathematics \
as Data\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] has the same section numbers.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a4acc596-0850-4b0a-afe9-72f34517a607"],

Cell["Before you start: choose Evaluation \[RightPointer] Quit Kernel \
\[RightPointer] Local.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1693f743-e381-480a-90f2-\
889b6e781612"],

Cell["1. Toolkit", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9ef3f091-ba70-42b7-bee3-332b45434774"],

Cell["\<\
Every function the unit uses. prefixOf writes a Wolfram expression as prefix \
tokens and fromPrefix reads them back (\[Section]3). nTrees[e, n] is the \
count D(e, n) of \[Section]4 and nBin its binary version; randomTree samples \
them uniformly (\[Section]5); decorate and randomExpr turn trees into \
expressions. bwd, fwd and ibpRound make integration data (\[Section]6); \
verifiedQ checks an answer by differentiating it (\[Section]7). The variable \
is Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s formal symbol \\[FormalX], which shows as a \
dotted x and can never be given a value by accident.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1f87765a-2ca0-44b2-aeed-f7fb0d90f168"],

