Cell["\<\
Check: {True, True, False, False}. x sin x + cos x and x sin x + cos x + 3 \
are accepted; x sin x and the unfinished sequence are rejected.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c078ef40-aea7-4f59-ac89-2ed28e98cd1d"],

Cell["8. Exercises", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"05179d08-46b9-4433-837a-2f4f6e592159"],

Cell["\<\
1. Write (x + 1)\.b2 in prefix notation and run the counter of \[Section]3.1 \
over it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"67dd2577-bbfd-4267-a012-79e4ca681128"],

Cell["\<\
2. Compute D(1, 3) by hand from the recurrence, using D(1, 2) = 6 and D(2, 1) \
= 4.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"351d8874-dba6-443b-8189-4bbdbbaebf83"],

Cell["\<\
3. With L = 2, p\:2081 = 2, p\:2082 = 1, compute E\:2083 from the corrected \
and the printed Equation 2. Which equals the count?\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a305cd94-b44c-4e4a-aa9d-9badfa715df4"],

Cell["\<\
4. For n = 3, what is the probability that Algorithm 2 makes the root binary?\
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"390ec2ff-9f86-4bac-ba49-63abf55ad1af"],

Cell["\<\
5. Use integration by parts, as in \[Section]6.1, to find \[Integral] x e\
\:02e3 dx, and check it by differentiating.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d6c51ec0-8895-42c1-8225-2e00f0afa529"],

Cell["Answers, computed:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6c0baaaf-c36d-4718-910e-fc9281ebd8ce"],

